 "read": "A reader for long-form newsletters (fictional; a kit test theme). Quiet, grey, typographic: the only hue is amber, and amber means one thing, new. Focus is weight and the caret, never the hue (focus fg): a minimal header with the name plain and bold, muted small-caps section titles, slash tabs, underlined text buttons in fg, lowercase labels, tags and table headers, like its name. Dialogs are ruled panels, like a pull quote. A ◐ for reading (the partial rung) beside ● new and ○ read, its ASCII twin ~ in the theme; the ladder names them: new in amber, reading, read, reviewed in subtle.",
